Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Rescue against Fate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 52
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come quick! Paddi is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, Green really did let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue merged everyone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is he trying to achieve by merging everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He also took the Absorption Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be to carry out his original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Original plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My drones will bring Weslie back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.71,0:01:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, follow me back to Green Green Grassland right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We must prepare for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we can use Peach’s World Teleportation Device to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about absorbing other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to stop me with? That ridiculous sticker of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could stop you once, I can stop you a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk big.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the weak mistake luck for skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.07,0:02:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You won’t get lucky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Absorption Device you guys destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me destroy it again and stop you from doing any more evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve wasted too much of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the great absorption plan begin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Absorption Device has merged with me now; let’s see how you destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ketian
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop lazing in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s time to go stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The world won’t end if I skip guard duty for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Pulling at my blanket?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to sleep in; surely that won’t cause the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to sleep in; surely that won’t cause the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,—Brother! —Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know. Let’s save them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s finally sprouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let’s hurry to the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening? Is this the end of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to activate the Protective Dome immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Use Peach’s device to return to Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safer than trying to force our way through the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what you just said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,about “preparing for the worst”—what did you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a device to prevent energy conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In the event that the Absorption Device ends up in Blue’s hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,this device might help you avert disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue has the Absorption Device now; regardless of whether Weslie can stop him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to get back to Green Green Grassland as soon as possible to protect the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right—Wolnie and Wilie are still back at Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:05:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach even foresaw this; I think she’s even more amazing than Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Said who? We are on the same level!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She even invented the World Teleportation Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach really is more capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening to this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Protective Dome of Goats’ Village isn’t working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, we need to bring the other survivors here for shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We only managed to bring back so few people…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’m just so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you’ve done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Goats’ Village has made it this far thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, Planie is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If we just channel the power from the Energization Prevention Device into the Goats’ Village Protective Dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the Dome will be reinforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.19,0:06:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Wolffy? Didn’t he come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to pick up Wolnie and Wilie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the sky splitting open?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, are we going to get sucked in too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don’t be afraid; Mommy is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Daddy is here to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you’re finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn’t the time for reminiscing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better take the drone to Goats’ Village for shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.81,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight—we’re taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should pilot instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That works too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the suction getting stronger the closer we get to Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about piloting, Wolnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll keep you both safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Wolffy family—quick, open the door and let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll take you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Weslie back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, he’s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go save the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there more and more rifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; I’ll definitely get you to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Queen Nuan and Lan Zhuzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is mostly safe now; let’s find a place to take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister Xi’er.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all my fault—I failed to grab Queen Nuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not talk about that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,More and more people are being sucked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But the suction force out there is so strong—how can we save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on my observations and analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the energy sphere sucks in energy molecules in a clockwise spiral pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as our bodies haven’t been energized yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we can rescue the people near Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But wouldn’t we get energized the moment we step outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; I’ve combined the Energization Prevention Device Peach gave me with these raincoats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you put them on, you’ll be able to temporarily resist the suction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and won’t get energized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t see it once the raincoat is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, you’re playing favorites! My raincoat is so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie’s is so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie has wings, after all, so it naturally needs to be a bit bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I don’t have a raincoat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stuffing is showing through your backside; leave the rescue work to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, let me help you patch up your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re too spread out; let’s split up to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he look so much like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t hold on so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,—Sister Xi’er! —Danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go save Xi’er.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys take them back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Weslie will definitely save Sister Xi’er.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right—trust Weslie.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
